23:27.899 --> 23:30.530
Astaga, maafkan aku. Maafkan aku.

23:50.320 --> 23:51.719
Jangan biarkan pikiranmu goyah.

23:52.490 --> 23:53.520
Tapi

23:54.060 --> 23:56.129
